lf standing on grass near a green surface and black railing." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6ad62e7f982a1.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:51:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>高地牛艾米</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad62e28704e8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;艾米，那头高地牛。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Shaggy brown cow with horns behind a fence near a blue umbrella and stuffed toys." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6ad62e28704e8.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:50:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>斯库尔基尔县法院钟</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad628c187b99</link><description>&lt;p&gt;斯库尔基尔县法院钟楼&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="White clock tower with Roman numerals against blue sky, tree in foreground." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6ad628c187b99.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:27:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>乐高 Jimothy！我用了三合一森林动物：灰狼套装（#31393）（https://www.lego.com/en-us/product/forest-animals-gray-wolf-31393）以及 Rebrickable 上 Psych0ticsl0th 的出色 Jimothy 说明书（https://rebrickable.com/mocs/MOC-277176/Psych0ticsl0th/jimothy/）。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad628578ef22</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乐高 Jimothy！我用了三合一森林动物：灰狼套装（#31393）（https://www.lego.com/en-us/product/forest-animals-gray-wolf-31393）以及 Rebrickable 上 Psych0ticsl0th 的出色 Jimothy 说明书（https://rebrickable.com/mocs/MOC-277176/Psych0ticsl0th/jimothy/）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="LEGO Jimothy the raccoon beside a framed sketch of him reading “NO SPINE DOIN’ FINE,” with colorful LEGO plants on a wooden shelf." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6ad628578ef22.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:25:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周末骑行酒庄赏景</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad608e3497aa</link><description>&lt;p&gt;还有一张是周末骑车去酒庄时拍的（我不喝酒，所以对我来说纯粹是为了看风景）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A landscape photo out over a vineyard. Behind the rows of vines an orange field, grass and then a lake which gives ways to many trees behind it. In the foreground a very out of place looking bright yellow sign states “CAUTION BEWARE OF SNAKES” with a little silhouette of a snake." height="5356" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6ad608e3497aa.jpg" width="4012"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:11:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周末波科宾骑行之旅照片</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad60790c17f3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;周末在波高尔宾周边骑行时拍的一张照片。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A photo taken from high with a straight road front and centre leading into the distance. The road is flanked by fields with vineyards and trees. In the distance, hazy hills and more fields. The light blue sky is full of white clouds " height="3751" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6ad60790c17f3.jpg" width="2809"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:05:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日程簿 · 2026年10月19日
